{"type":"text","timestamp":1794347779385,"sessionID":"ses_e38b116b4ffebamEgV72HvBIPS","part":{"id":"prt_1c7764520001xCm4sMB24zINNM","messageID":"msg_1c775fb01001i9UTJQ3kCtPAQp","sessionID":"ses_e38b116b4ffebamEgV72HvBIPS","type":"text","text":"Done. The bank is built and verified end-to-end.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`, Flask + stdlib `sqlite3`):\n- Auth: `register` (201, 409 on duplicate), `login` (200 `{\"token\"}`), `logout`, `csrf` — sessions in SQLite, scrypt password hashes, `Authorization: Bearer` on every request (401 otherwise)\n- `GET /api/account`, `POST/GET /api/transfers`, `GET /api/transfers/{id}` with the exact transfer shape, `direction`, and `{items, total, page, page_size}` envelope (newest first)\n- Money stored as integer cents; transfers run inside `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` so both balance updates + the insert commit or roll back together (verified: 20 concurrent transfers against a 1000.00 balance → exactly 10 succeed, balances exact)\n- Errors answer 4xx with a message (`insufficient balance`, `recipient not found`, …); CSRF token is issued and enforced only when the header is presented\n- Serves `frontend/dist` with SPA fallback; unknown `/api/*` paths return JSON 404; `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`; data in `./data/bank.db` (WAL), survives restart\n\n**Frontend** (React 19 + TS + Vite 8 + Tailwind 4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`, only `src/index.css` holds `@import \"tailwindcss\"`):\n- Sign in / register tabs, signed-in username + sign out in the header\n- Prominent balance card, transfer form → review step → confirm, showing the API's message (e.g. insufficient balance) on failure\n- Transaction history table (direction badge, other party, ±amount, memo, date) with page-size 10 paging and auto-jump to page 1 after a transfer\n\n**Verified**: 80-case E2E suite passed (auth, guards, validation, visibility, paging/ordering, CSRF, assets, concurrency), `npm ci` + `npm run build` + `tsc --noEmit` clean, restart persistence checked. Docker isn't available in this sandbox, but every Dockerfile step (lockfile installs, `npm run build`, gunicorn `app:app` on :8000) was exercised directly.","time":{"start":1794347779360,"end":1794347779363}}}
